tag": ""}, {"src": "/wp-content/uploads/2019/12/IMG_0139-scaled.jpg", "title": "Vinyl Wrap Toronto - Vehicle Wrap In Toronto - Print Shop - Truck Vinyl Stickers Full Side", "tag": ""}], "eid": "4c9998b"}], "padding": "0px 0px 20px 0px", "maxWidth": null, "minHeight": null, "background": "#FFFFFF", "bgImage": null, "bgSize": null, "bgPosition": null, "bgRepeat": null}, {"id": "b45e69d", "blocks": [{"type": "columns", "cols": [{"width": 74.87, "blocks": [{"type": "text", "html": "<h4>Truck Stickers Vinyl Wrap</h4> <p>A regular Vinyl Wrap Toronto client, Gateway, brought us their brand new salt truck to add branding and company logo. We achieved this by adding onto the truck stickers. You can see that the truck was just like any other salt truck on the road. The client wanted to use the vehicle to advertise his services while on the road. The vehicle’s decals will help to advertise the company as a mobile sign throughout the coming winter.<br/>Our installation crew used the design team’s proof to ensure we completed the job to the customer’s satisfaction. You can see the proofs we used for this truck stickers wrap. We always get the client’s approval before we start the installation to ensure the customer is satisfied with the final result. The vinyl we used at VWT is rated to last up to 7 years even in the harshest weather. We all know that a salt truck does not stay in the car park when the snow starts. So the vinyl needs to keep up with whatever the weather throws at the truck. If you have any questions about getting decals on your company or personal vehicle, give VWT a call at <a href=\"tel:416-746-1381\">416-746-1381</a>.</p> <p>Check our 3M and Avery Dennison page <a href=\"/car-wrap-colours-avery-dennison-3m/\">here</a> for more colours and finishes.</p> <p>Follow us on <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/vinylwraptoronto/\">Facebook</a> and <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/vinylwraptoronto/\">Instagram</a></p> <p>If you would like to know more about our services, visit us in-store at <a href=\"https://g.page/vinylwraptoronto?share\">24 Ronson Dr, Unit 1, Etobicoke, ON, M9W 1B4</a></p> <p>We also offer Corporate Apparel through <a href=\"https://workweartoronto.com/\">Workwear Toronto</a> and <a href=\"https://www.print3etobicoke.com/\">Printing Services with Print3</a>. We can take your company logo and put it onto any products or vehicles you wish as well as brand your workwear.</p> <p>To check out more truck wraps click <a href=\"/truck-lettering-and-decals-toronto/\">here</a>.</p>", "style": "text-align:start;font-family:\"Poppins\", Sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5em;font-weight:300", "eid": "85e4764"}, {"type": "postnav", "prev": {"href": "/truck-vinyl-wrap-toronto/", "text": "Prev Previous Vinyl Wrap Toronto – Truck Wrap – Custom Vehicle Wraps"}, "next": {"href": "/stickerspartial-or-full-wraps/", "text": "Next Stickers, Partial or Full Wrap – Commercial Vehicle Wraps Next"}, "eid": "0144f5b"}]}, {"width": 25.0, "blocks": [{"type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "Limited Time Offer", "href": null, "style": "text-align:center;font-family:\"Poppins\", Sans-serif;font-size:22px;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:500", "eid": "6026500"}, {"type": "heading", "level": 2, "text": "Get a Standard 3M or Avery Manufactured Full Wrap for a Tesla at", "href": null, "style": "text-align:center;font-family:\"Poppins\", Sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.4em;color:var( --e-global-color-a8178e9 );font-weight:500", "tag": "p", "eid": "adce94b"}, {"type": "heading", "level": 3, "text": "$4,500 $3,500", "href": null, "style": null, "eid": "a36b238"}, {"type": "button", "text": "Claim Now", "href": "#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dpopup%3Aopen%26settings%3DeyJpZCI6IjIyMDU1IiwidG9nZ2xlIjpmYWxzZX0%3D", "icon": null, "style": "text-align:center;font-family:\"Poppins\", Sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#FFFFFF;font-weight:500;text-transform:uppercase", "eid": "e4d3235"}, {"type": "toc", "title": "Table of Contents", "eid": "7d98824"}, 